  "content": "<p>FTB工業機械是款科技模組！至少我是這麼聽說的……來，看看這些物品！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-industrial-contraptions/2TTKNHi.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本模組使用 ⚡（電擊）作為能量系統，運作方式與RF略有不同。若不注意，你的機器可能會損壞！</p><p>發電機：</p><p>- 基礎發電機以煤炭為燃料，每秒產出10⚡</p><p>- 地熱發電機使用岩漿，每秒產出20⚡</p><p>- 太陽能板依等級產出電力，範圍從1-256⚡/t</p><p>- 風力發電機依Y軸高度及周圍空間大小產電，6+⚡/t</p><p>- 核反應爐……尚未實裝。抱歉！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>機器：</p><p>- 動力熔爐可熔煉物品！</p><p>- 研磨機將礦物變成粉塵。事實上，它能把大多數東西都磨成粉……</p><p>- 離心機可分離物質。想從海鞘中提取螢石時超好用！</p><p>- 壓縮機能製作至少兩種實用物品</p><p>- 採石場可快速大範圍開採礦物</p><p>- 還有更多！快來模組中探索吧！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>不只如此！我們還有……</p><p>- 碳纖維裝甲與量子裝甲 - 穿上後幾乎無敵。直到電力耗盡……那時你就變得很脆弱了。</p><p>- 動力鞘翅 - 受夠翅膀一直損壞了嗎？別擔心，現在它們會改成一直沒電！</p><p>- 機器升級 - 讓弱機器變強的廉價手段</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>製作名單</strong></p><p>本模組靈感來自Alblaka原創概念的「工業模組」。『FTB工業機械』所有內容均由FTB團隊創作</p><p>材質由<a href=\"https://github.com/Ridanisaurus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Ridanisaurus</a> Rid繪製</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-industrial-contraptions/utyMDp0.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-industrial-contraptions/qCFuCmM.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-industrial-contraptions/ucmJGtb.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>支援</h2><ul>\n<li>關於<strong>整合包</strong>問題，請造訪：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>關於<strong>模組</strong>問題，請造訪：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有其他疑問？歡迎加入Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>追蹤最新動態</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
